  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Contribution au PRODAP II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Il est envisag&#xe9; de signer avec KFW. Dans le pass&#xe9;, il n&apos;ont pas accept&#xe9; de signer un contrat directement dans OPSYS. D&#xe8;s lors, nous avons choisi l&apos;option &apos;summa workflow&apos;. Selon le wiki, cette option est &#xe0; envisager quand: &quot;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(40, 40, 50);&quot;&gt;SUMMA Workflow for a Contract to be managed outside of the system, where no Procedure is initiated in the system; The contract is manually entered in MAP, following the signature of the Contract; and the closure of the Contract is done manually. This applicable for Trust Funds&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
